text:
#HastiAmiri, student and activist, has been held incommunicado for 11 days after being arrested at a memorial in Mashhad. Denied phone, lawyer, or info on her location. This is enforced disappearance, not “temporary detention.”
#IRGCterrorists
@drmaisato
@UNHumanRights

